msgid "Welcome to the Museum of Alternative Displays"
msgstr "歡迎來到另類顯示博物館"

#: interface
#. Entrance page.
msgctxt "ui.entrance.intro"
msgid "The collection fills seven halls, from the split-flap board to the hologram. Every piece in the museum is running. Turn each one around, look inside it, and switch the daylight off to see which of them still show a picture at night."
msgstr "館藏分布在七個展廳，從翻頁顯示板到全像圖。館裡的每件展品都在運轉。把它轉著看一看，往裡面瞧一瞧，再關掉日光，看哪些展品到了夜裡還能顯示畫面。"

